{"5122510":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Decadrive","steam_appid":5122510,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5205720],"detailed_description":"<strong>The road doesn't end. You do.<\/strong><br><br>Decadrive is a top-down arcade racer about one impossible commute: endless traffic, a fuel gauge that's always dying, and ten phases that loop back around harder, faster, and meaner every cycle. You don't finish this road — you see how far you get before it finishes you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RUN<\/h2>Thread the needle between trucks at full speed. Every overtake feeds your combo. Every near-miss pays. Every mistake is the last one — until you hit retry, because you will hit retry.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER TRIP<\/h2>Seven ways to cheat death: <strong>nitro<\/strong> through the gap, <strong>shield<\/strong> through the crash, <strong>slow-mo<\/strong> through the impossible, <strong>EMP<\/strong> the whole screen clean, turn <strong>ghost<\/strong>, drag coins in with the <strong>magnet<\/strong>, and pray for <strong>fuel rain<\/strong> when the needle hits red.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ROAD FIGHTS BACK<\/h2>Some phases don't just throw traffic at you. <strong>Bosses<\/strong> own this highway — learn their patterns or become part of the asphalt. Clear phases 5 and 10 and <strong>hazard arenas<\/strong> (Roadbreaker, Siege Warlord) turn the road into a gauntlet.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN YOUR RIDE<\/h2>Every run pays out. Spend it in the <strong>garage<\/strong> — new cars, new colors — and climb a <strong>skill tree<\/strong> that turns your next run from desperate to dangerous. XP, credits, shop upgrades: dying has never been this productive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE MORE RUN<\/h2>Beat all ten phases? The road laughs and starts <strong>cycle two<\/strong>. Chase your high score, hunt <strong>15 in-game achievements<\/strong>, and find out where your limit really is.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pure single-player arcade — no waiting, no lobbies, just you and the road<br><\/li><li> <strong>Survival mode<\/strong> for when the campaign feels too polite<br><\/li><li> UI in <strong>9 languages<\/strong>: English, Portuguese (BR), Spanish, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Korean<br><\/li><li> Keyboard and gamepad friendly<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<strong>The road doesn't end. You do.<\/strong><br><br>Decadrive is a top-down arcade racer about one impossible commute: endless traffic, a fuel gauge that's always dying, and ten phases that loop back around harder, faster, and meaner every cycle. You don't finish this road — you see how far you get before it finishes you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RUN<\/h2>Thread the needle between trucks at full speed. Every overtake feeds your combo. Every near-miss pays. Every mistake is the last one — until you hit retry, because you will hit retry.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER TRIP<\/h2>Seven ways to cheat death: <strong>nitro<\/strong> through the gap, <strong>shield<\/strong> through the crash, <strong>slow-mo<\/strong> through the impossible, <strong>EMP<\/strong> the whole screen clean, turn <strong>ghost<\/strong>, drag coins in with the <strong>magnet<\/strong>, and pray for <strong>fuel rain<\/strong> when the needle hits red.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ROAD FIGHTS BACK<\/h2>Some phases don't just throw traffic at you. <strong>Bosses<\/strong> own this highway — learn their patterns or become part of the asphalt. Clear phases 5 and 10 and <strong>hazard arenas<\/strong> (Roadbreaker, Siege Warlord) turn the road into a gauntlet.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN YOUR RIDE<\/h2>Every run pays out. Spend it in the <strong>garage<\/strong> — new cars, new colors — and climb a <strong>skill tree<\/strong> that turns your next run from desperate to dangerous. XP, credits, shop upgrades: dying has never been this productive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE MORE RUN<\/h2>Beat all ten phases? The road laughs and starts <strong>cycle two<\/strong>. Chase your high score, hunt <strong>15 in-game achievements<\/strong>, and find out where your limit really is.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pure single-player arcade — no waiting, no lobbies, just you and the road<br><\/li><li> <strong>Survival mode<\/strong> for when the campaign feels too polite<br><\/li><li> UI in <strong>9 languages<\/strong>: English, Portuguese (BR), Spanish, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Korean<br><\/li><li> Keyboard and gamepad friendly<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Outrun a road that never ends. Decadrive is a top-down arcade racer about endless traffic, a fuel gauge that is always dying, and ten phases that come back harder every cycle. Dodge, boost and chain overtakes into combos, then spend what you earn on faster cars and a deadlier skill tree.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5122510\/9cdf5ad4772380185593ceaf30959987fa86d80d\/header.jpg?t=1793662412","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5122510\/4f69ce3a222ff1cf7d699f32a03979ca4169df69\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793662412","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5122510\/4f69ce3a222ff1cf7d699f32a03979ca4169df69\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793662412","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 \/ Vulkan capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU with Vulkan support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS 64-bit \/ SteamOS<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 \/ Vulkan capable GPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 64-bit \/ SteamOS<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core 2.5 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU with Vulkan support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"developers":["MARVIN BRAGA SISTEMAS LTDA"],"publishers":["MARVIN BRAGA SISTEMAS LTDA"],"demos":[{"appid":5205720,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":615,"final":553,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"6,15€","final_formatted":"5,53€"},"packages":[1774163],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Decadrive","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1774163,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Decadrive - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">6,15€<\/span> 5,53€","option_description":"","can_get_f